<mjml>
<!--
  IMPECCABLE DIRECTION CONTRACT
  THESIS: nothing to celebrate, nothing alarming — a distributor is entitled
  to decline a connection request, and the honest, calm read is a plain
  white card, not a colored band. Every other email in this set uses its
  band color to carry status meaning (amber = pending, blue = positive); the
  deliberate ABSENCE of a band here is itself the signal — this is DESIGN.md's
  own established pattern (the badges section: "no relationship/active state
  renders a badge at all — absence of a badge is itself the 'all good'
  signal") applied to an email that isn't "all good" but also isn't a fault.
  OWN-WORLD: apps/portal/DESIGN.md, inherited from invite.mjml — same
  header/footer chrome, same floated-identity technique. No CTA — there's
  nothing to click, the relationship isn't active. Distributor contact
  matters most here of any email in the set (the one place "how do I ask
  why" is the natural next question), so it's front and center, not just in
  the footer's optional line.
  STORY: a customer whose request was declined understands plainly that it
  was, knows they can ask the distributor directly or try again later, and
  isn't left wondering if something is broken or if this is personal.
  FIRST VIEWPORT: header, one plain white section — headline, distributor
  identity + the decline sentence, a reassurance line — then the footer
  (which already surfaces the distributor contact line when available).
  FORM: extends the established world; direction was already set.
  FINISH: verified via a real MJML render/screenshot + a real MailHog send.
-->
<mj-head>
  <mj-title>Your request to connect with {{distributorName}}</mj-title>
  <mj-font name="Inter" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" />
  <mj-attributes>
    <mj-text font-size="14px" font-weight="400" line-height="1.5" color="#0B1D3A" padding="0" />
  </mj-attributes>
  <mj-style>
    @media only screen and (max-width:480px) {
      .distributor-byline-logo {
        width: 44px !important;
        height: 44px !important;
        border-radius: 23px !important;
      }
    }
  </mj-style>
</mj-head>
<mj-body background-color="#F2F4F7" width="480px">

  {{> header}}

  <mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="32px 32px 32px" border-left="1px solid #E6ECF2" border-right="1px solid #E6ECF2">
    <mj-column>
      <mj-text font-size="24px" font-weight="600" line-height="1.3" color="#0B1D3A" padding-bottom="16px">
        Request declined
      </mj-text>
      {{> identity-row}}
      <mj-text color="#5B6B7F" padding-bottom="0">
        You're welcome to send another request in future.
      </mj-text>
    </mj-column>
  </mj-section>

  {{> footer}}

</mj-body>
</mjml>
